    "details": "AddPadding validates input_offset, derives the padding count from the full data array length, then writes at that offset. RemovePadding requires block alignment and count <= block_size. GetPaddingCount ignores input_offset and validates only a nonempty matching suffix and count <= data length; it accepts nonaligned lengths and counts above block_size, using the source full-buffer masked bitwise scan."
